WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.230
In Maps, use the sidebar plus to create a Map.

2
00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:06.815
Open the Map’s menu and choose New Line.

3
00:00:06.815 --> 00:00:10.063
Name the Line and choose Create Line.

4
00:00:10.063 --> 00:00:12.629
Open the Line’s menu and choose Add Station.

5
00:00:12.629 --> 00:00:17.272
Name the Station and create it. It now belongs to the Line.
